<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to announce August federal tax receipts.</title>
<headline>Brazil to announce August federal tax receipts.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Federal Tax Secretariat was due to announce tax receipts for the month of August, an official said.</p>
<p>The numbers would be revealed at 1600 local/1900 GMT, he said.</p>
<p>-- William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358</p>
</text>
